# Frozen public export surface of services/api — Phase 4 baseline.
# 238 named exports + the default axios instance. Generated from the
# pre-split monolithic services/api.js at commit 95aa3d3; startBridgeCall
# (Twilio Voice click-to-call bridge) and getEventApplication (BHPH
# credit-application viewer) added post-baseline.
#
# The guard at scripts/check-api-exports.mjs asserts the union of named
# exports across services/api/*.js (client + all domain modules, minus the
# barrel) equals this list exactly. If you add or rename an API function,
# update this file in the same commit — a drift is a public-contract change.
#
# default export: api (the shared axios instance, defined in client.js)
